&lt;h3 id="tourism-digitalization-platform-360-virtual-travel"&gt;Tourism Digitalization Platform (360° Virtual Travel)
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-stack Developer - Graduation Thesis | &lt;strong&gt;May 2025 - August 2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built a microservices-based tourism platform (&lt;strong&gt;Spring Boot&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Python/Flask&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Next.js&lt;/strong&gt;) for managing interactive 360° virtual destinations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designed a &lt;strong&gt;Docker Compose&lt;/strong&gt; infrastructure with &lt;strong&gt;Kong Gateway&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;RabbitMQ&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL/MongoDB&lt;/strong&gt;, and separate client/admin Next.js frontends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implemented secure API routing (JWT, rate limiting, logging) and media pipelines for uploading, extracting, and serving 360° assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/HoangDuonng/graduation-project-overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
