&lt;li&gt;Built an adaptive testing platform using the &lt;strong&gt;3PL-IRT&lt;/strong&gt; model and &lt;strong&gt;CAT&lt;/strong&gt;, including backend modules for students/exams/question banks with per-item difficulty parameters and an automated 3PL-IRT scoring pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://ued-smart.education.vnu.edu.vn" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
