&lt;h3 id="document-conversion--ocr-system"&gt;Document Conversion &amp;amp; OCR System
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt; DevOps Support / Full-stack Developer - Team of 6 | &lt;strong&gt;October 2024 - February 2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Created an OCR-based document processing system (PDF → DOCX, ID extraction) with real-time processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieved over &lt;strong&gt;98%&lt;/strong&gt; text recognition accuracy and reduced processing time by &lt;strong&gt;60%&lt;/strong&gt; with a microservices architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributed to deployment on &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/strong&gt; using an IaC approach with &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; and CI/CD pipelines via GitHub and Jenkins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborated with a teammate to set up container orchestration and production deployment using &lt;strong&gt;Helm&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
